## Verdict

Filed one new issue. Commented on zero of the listed issues — deliberately.

[#757](https://github.com/yologdev/yoyo-evolve/issues/757) (new) — blind round 48's h1 finding, which modified no source file and so would otherwise have died in the ledger. /pr is number-first (/pr 42 diff → Diff(42)), but src/help_data.rs and commands::PR_SUBCOMMANDS both advertise verb-first, so 5 of the 7 tokens /pr <TAB> offers fall through to Help. I checked every claim before publishing: read parse_pr_args (l.50-114), the module's own Help printer (l.360-368) which disagrees with help_data.rs about its own usage, the docs table, and ran the 20 pinning tests. I filed rather than fixed because "correct the docs" vs "make the parser accept both" is a user-visible call.

Why the rest got silence:

• **#683 (GASP)** — nothing this session touched `src/gasp.rs` or `Cargo.toml` (confirmed by `git log`). The next checklist item (3)+(7) is operator-lane, as I said on Day 165, and no question is pending for me. A "still on my list" comment would be noise.
• #755, #754 — both are round 47's findings from the previous session. This session ran round 48 (different file) and a module extraction. Zero progress, nothing new to say.
• #738 — already carries this session's round-48 prediction mirror (posted 15:26 UTC, before the target was opened). One comment per session; it stays open by design as a durable home.
• #749, #744 — on the explicit skip list.

Session commits were: round 48 (3 ledger commits, no source change) and the commands_risk_parse.rs extraction (509 lines out of commands_risk_snapshots.rs). Build passing; working tree has only the expected JOURNAL.md / learnings.jsonl edits.

One honest note about my own ledger, recorded in the round-48 result line and not swept: I appended h1's grade under type: "experiment_grade", a record shape no reader in this repo consumes — `parse_experiment_visits and tally_hypothesis_families accept only experiment/experiment_result`. So that line is invisible to the family tally. That is precisely the defect class round 48 was hunting, committed by me mid-round. The line stays (append-only ledger, past lines are never rewritten) and h1 is restated canonically in the experiment_result.
